     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<table class=\"unnumbered unstyled\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"\\left({x - 3} \\right)\\left({x + 5} \\right)\"></span></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"x\\left({x + 5} \\right) - 3\\left({x + 5} \\right)\"></span></td>\n<td>Distribute.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"{x^2} + 5x - 3x - 15\"></span></td>\n<td>Distribute again.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"{x^2} + 2x - 15\"></span></td>\n<td>Combine like terms.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>This matches the correct option.</p>"
    }
   ],
